The QR residual-sign bootstrap preprocessing engine in R/bootstrap.R follows
the algorithm implemented by quantreg::boot.rq.pxy. The quantreg package is
distributed under GPL (>= 2), which is compatible with this package's
GPL (>= 2) license:

  https://cran.r-project.org/package=quantreg

The exact BR, FN, preprocessing, and multi-quantile QR paths call public
functions from quantreg. No quantreg source code is copied into this package.
Cox fitting calls survival::coxph.fit(); no survival source code is copied.
